{"version":1,"key":"card:587","content":{"id":587,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8c71d992-8755-4e03-92c5-981e949eee86","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"原型链是 JavaScript 实现继承的一种机制，当访问一个对象上不存在的属性时，会从它的原型上去查找。每一个对象上都存在一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"prototype "},{"type":"formatted","text":"属性，指向的就是其原型对象，原型对象上也存在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"prototype"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，可以发现，通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"prototype"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 形成了一条链表，这个通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"prototype"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 形成的链表称为原型链，原型链的最顶端为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Object"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象，它的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"prototype"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"null"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"08f5aa28-076c-44e0-89b0-d616dfb5714e","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"instanceof"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 操作符判断一个对象 A 是否是另一个对象 B 的实例，它的底层原理就是通过原型链实现的，即判断对象 B 的原型是否在对象 A 的原型链上，如果在，则说明 A 是 B 的实例。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"8ff1d2be-bdc2-43ec-bfad-aed7cb1155a8","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"b3a53381-3859-41d1-9581-2f8ccf0c9604","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"function myInstanceOf(obj, constructor) {\n    // 基本类型直接返回 false\n    if (obj === null || typeof obj !== 'object' && typeof obj !== 'function') {\n        return false;\n    }\n    \n    // 获取对象的原型\n    let proto = Object.getPrototypeOf(obj);\n    \n    while (true) {\n        // 如果到达原型链顶端\n        if (proto === null) {\n            return false;\n        }\n        \n        // 如果找到了构造函数的 prototype\n        if (proto === constructor.prototype) {\n            return true;\n        }\n        \n        // 继续向上查找原型链\n        proto = Object.getPrototypeOf(proto);\n    }\n}","collabId":"4658c291-0f51-443e-ba49-44e86ab3417a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"76069b89-b5cf-4fab-8c3c-15e2adb9d610","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"为对象设置原型的方法有这么几种："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"a07561da-2958-4f81-aacd-942810d04331","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"dd1e5209-cfe9-401e-9e81-5abf485f0222","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9ef99ce0-a3d4-4923-871a-0e05076af8f3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当我们通过 "},{"type":"content-link","contentId":1402,"contentType":"card","contentTitle":"","refId":570,"tauContract":"720a42c66441f65bfc897253311b73deb687a68a60da46dffe8c7b8537a65760","collabId":"379e2819-3475-4044-9da2-63db47388b70","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"new"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 创建一个对象时，会自动将新创建对象的原型设置为构造函数的原型"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"a3b7506f-a4a3-4a38-ab71-c262768daea4","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9cc4aea4-e9c1-488e-a5e6-1b2ce5ca855a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Object.create"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 指定新创建对象的原型"}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"info","title":"","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","collabId":"598abc78-e735-4c0c-aa58-e8e5f6e6557c","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"339fec53-ea5a-437f-b3d7-748368841830","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可以通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Object.create(null)"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 创建一个没有原型的对象。"}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"7667f4bf-2026-4cce-bc9a-b9a58f1507e9","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1dc6062c-46d5-4f56-95ee-9a20eeca89aa","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Object.setPrototypeOf"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 修改对象的原型"}]}]}]}],"tags":["JavaScript/原型"],"createTime":1745406104142,"updateTime":1748397144879,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1748397144879},"links":{"card:570":{"key":"card:570","type":"card","id":570}}}